1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,820
A billionaire told a jury he paid two million for fake wine.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,240
So who sold it? A guy named Rudy Kurniawan, a wine collector in California.

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:14,640
Now, fancy old wine gets sold at auctions, where rich people bid and the highest price wins.

4
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:19,180
In two thousand six, Rudy's collection sold for about thirty-five million dollars.

5
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,880
That's a thousand bucks a day for ninety-five years.

6
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,260
Tap the heart if your wine has a screw cap.

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,920
One of his sales even set a world record.

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:31,500
But here's what prosecutors said was going on at his house.

9
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,300
Step one, he mixed old wine with newer wine.

10
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:38,460
Step two, he poured it into old bottles, with fresh corks and wax.

11
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:43,220
Step three, he added a label, and that house held thousands of labels.

12
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,660
Yeah, prosecutors literally called it a wine factory.

13
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,680
Send this to the friend who— who swirls the glass.

14
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,920
So how'd he get caught? Nope, not a taste test.

15
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,320
A New York auction listed his bottles of one French wine.

16
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,960
Some of those labels were dated nineteen forty-five.

17
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,820
The dumbest part's next, so follow.

18
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:06,260
The actual winemaker objected, because his family first made that wine in nineteen eighty-two.

19
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,700
So the label was thirty-seven years older than the wine.

20
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:15,280
The FBI arrested Rudy in twenty twelve, and a jury convicted him of fraud.

21
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:17,580
He was sentenced to ten years in prison.

22
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:20,260
And he had to pay back over twenty-eight million dollars.

23
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:23,620
So be real, could you taste a fake wine?

